<title>NORWAY: Norway issues new 12-month T-bill for NOK 5.5 bln.</title>
<headline>Norway issues new 12-month T-bill for NOK 5.5 bln.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's central bank, Norges Bank, said on Thursday the Finance Ministry had issued a new treasury bill, SS48, for 5.5 billion crowns, with 500 million crowns reserved for the bank.</p>
<p>The T-bill will be issued via ordinary auction with the deadline for tenders on July 7. Settlement is on July 9.</p>
<p>The T-bill has a nominal interest rate of four percent and matures on June 17, 1998.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
